  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutants-and-zombies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1204883?logo=curseforge&logoColor=black&label=&labelColor=orange&color=242424\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmutants-and-zombies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mutants-and-zombies?style=flat&logo=modrinth&logoColor=black&label=&labelColor=18ED49&color=242424\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutants-and-zombies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1204883(4F21AC).svg\" alt=\"支援版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/rSVp3nCpPx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1388544059114786907?style=flat&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=blue\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D71EVQVC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-75D5E3?logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"靜態徽章\"></a></p>\n<p>本模組為遊戲新增了多種變異生物與殭屍。此為「Ryan's Zombies」模組的官方重製版本。所有模型均由玩家「Nice_Try_Boi」創作並提供。</p>\n<p>目前可用的生物如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>殭屍蠻兵</strong> - 體型極大且防禦力極高的坦克型殭屍 (ID: <code>mutantszombies:zombie_brute</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>爬行殭屍</strong>&nbsp;- 體型小巧、速度快捷，具備攀爬能力&nbsp;(ID: <code>mutantszombies:crawler</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>吐息殭屍</strong> - 會發射史萊姆彈&nbsp;(ID: <code>mutantszombies:spitter</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>水泡殭屍</strong> - 速度更快、力量更強的殭屍 (ID: <code>mutantszombies:blister_zombie</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>裂頭殭屍</strong> -&nbsp;速度更快、力量更強的殭屍 (ID: <code>mutantszombies:split_head_zombie</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>變異蠻兵</strong> -&nbsp;體型極大且防禦力極高的坦克型變異生物 (ID: <code>mutantszombies:mutant_brute</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>腐爛變異生物</strong> -&nbsp;比殭屍更高大、更強壯但速度較慢 (ID: <code>mutantszombies:rotten_mutant</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>設定</strong></h3>\n<hr>\n<p>本模組提供簡易的設定檔，用於開啟或關閉生物的天然生成。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Forge</span></em></span> - 設定檔依世界儲存：<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <em>minecraft/saves/[你的世界名稱]/serverconfig/mutantszombies-server.toml</em></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">NeoForge</span></em></span> - 設定檔依 Minecraft 安裝路徑／執行個體儲存：<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <em>minecraft/config/mutantszombies-server.toml</em></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Fabric</span></em></span> - 設定檔依 Minecraft 安裝路徑／執行個體儲存：<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <em>minecraft/config/mutantszombies.json5</em></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
